{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"罗纳德·里根·争议与多元评价","stage":"DONE","category":"ronald-reagan","categoryLabel":"罗纳德·里根","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/22_ronald-reagan/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<p>罗纳德·里根在 1989 年离开白宫时，盖洛普民调显示他的支持率约为 63%，是二战后卸任总统中最高之一；然而同一位总统留给后人的，还有一桩几乎拖垮第二任期的对外丑闻、一笔从约一万亿美元膨胀到近三万亿美元的联邦债务，以及一场在他沉默近五年后才被公开承认的瘟疫。这种鲜明的反差，正是本卷要处理的题目：里根既被保守派奉为重塑美国的伟人，也被批评者视为加剧不平等、纵容违法、对弱势者冷漠的总统。</p>\n<p>本卷不打算给里根下一个非黑即白的结论，而是把争议本身当作研究对象。我们关心的是：当时究竟发生了什么、各方的事实依据是什么、为何同样一组史实会被截然不同地解读。围绕里根的争论之所以经久不衰，恰恰因为它触及美国政治最根本的分歧——政府该多大、市场该多自由、领袖的个人魅力能否抵消政策的代价。</p>\n<p>全卷分为三章，由具体到整体。第一章「经济争议」拆解涓滴经济学与贫富分化之争，以及巨额赤字如何把美国从世界最大债权国变成最大债务国。第二章「丑闻与失败」聚焦伊朗门事件这桩里根任内最严重的危机，以及政府在艾滋病疫情面前的迟缓应对。第三章「多元评价」退后一步，呈现保守派与自由派对里根遗产的两极化判断，以及史学界排名背后的方法论之争。</p>\n<p>阅读时建议先看与本卷互为表里的其它侧面：本卷批评的政策，其正面叙述在「核心政策」与「政治思想」两卷；本卷涉及的事件细节，可回溯到「重大事件」卷；而这些争议如何沉淀为长期遗产，则在「影响与遗产」卷展开。把赞誉与批评对照着读，才能看到一个完整而复杂的里根。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economic-controversies","title":"Economic Controversies","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/economic-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inequality-and-trickle-down","title":"涓滴经济学与贫富分化之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/economic-controversies/inequality-and-trickle-down"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deficits-and-debt","title":"赤字与债务：从最大债权国到最大债务国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/economic-controversies/deficits-and-debt"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"scandals-and-failures","title":"Scandals And Failures","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/scandals-and-failures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-iran-contra-affair","title":"伊朗门事件：以武器换人质换游击队","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/scandals-and-failures/the-iran-contra-affair"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-aids-crisis-response","title":"艾滋病疫情：迟来的官方回应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/scandals-and-failures/the-aids-crisis-response"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"Diverse Appraisals","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"great-or-overrated","title":"伟大还是被高估：里根遗产的两极评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/great-or-overrated"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判：排名背后的方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/ronald-reagan/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment"}]}]}